  "Package": "smoothclust",
  "Version": "1.9.6",
  "Title": "smoothclust",
  "Description": "Tools for spatial domain analysis in spatial\ntranscriptomics data. Includes spatial smoothing of gene\nexpression profiles for downstream clustering and a boundary\ndensity (BD) metric for summarizing spatial domain\norganization. The smoothing function returns processed\nexpression values for subsequent clustering. BD requires only\nspatial coordinates and categorical labels, and provides local\nand sample-level summaries of label transitions.",
